### JetBrains HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client / httpyac. Set {{host}} and {{token}} in an environment file.
@host = http://127.0.0.1:8787

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ask
POST {{host}}/api/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "q": "Who bears the burden of proof?", "mode": "ask", "k": 8 }

### Search only (no model)
POST {{host}}/api/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "q": "burden of proof", "k": 5 }

### Sources and BibTeX keys
GET {{host}}/api/sources
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bibliography as RIS / CSL JSON / BibTeX
GET {{host}}/api/bib?fmt=ris
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mesh: what this node offers, search the peers
GET {{host}}/api/mesh/manifest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/search?q=burden&mesh=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Audit a draft's citations (no model)
POST {{host}}/api/audit
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": "The burden of proof lies with the assessing body [@lisbon_convention, p. 1]."}
